{"title":"Silver Dagger","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Weapon Smithing Lv 16)</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-req\"><b>Requires</b> Lvl 15 · DEX 45 <span class=\"muted\">to equip</span></p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Weapon Smithing at level 16 <span class=\"muted\">(338 XP)</span> from 3× <a href=\"#/item/silver-bar\">Silver Bar</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div class=\"s muted\">No monster drops recorded for this item.</div>\n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/weapon-smithing\">Weapon smithing</a></p>\n      <h2>Quality</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Quality\"><a class=\"q-chip on q-all\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-inferior\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=inferior\">Inferior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-crude\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=crude\">Crude</a><a class=\"q-chip q-shoddy\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=shoddy\">Shoddy</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=ordinary\">Ordinary</a><a class=\"q-chip q-good\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=good\">Good</a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=excellent\">Excellent</a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=superior\">Superior</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/silver-dagger?q=flawless\">Flawless</a></div><div class=\"q-picker w-ench\" data-gear=\"silver-dagger\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Enchant\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip on\" data-wench=\"\">No enchant</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"destruction\">Destruction</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"burn\">Flame</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"freeze\">Freezing</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" data-wench=\"shock\">Storm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"q-chip\" d